    expect called Backend.people.remove
}"#, title: "wf")
        }
        Markdown("A test that names `fakes:` runs in a browser, where the page makes its calls; nothing is sent. A call to an endpoint no fake answers fails the test and names it. With a contract from an OpenAPI spec, `fake Examples for Backend.people from examples` answers from the spec's examples. A fake that answers an endpoint the group does not have, reads a parameter it does not take, or answers with the wrong type is `N06`.\n\nA build leaves fakes out. To load every page of the site in a browser with the fakes answering — for a site whose API is elsewhere — run `wf verify --fakes tests/fakes.wf`, naming the file that holds them. More in [Testing](/learn/16-testing#answer-a-service-with-fakes).")

    }
}
